    "scenesThatPass": [
      "JUNE: Amen.\nJUNE: Lunchtime! Line up single-file.\nMIDGE: My word! It's hot.\nDINAH: It's the desert. What'd you expect?",
      "SHELLY: Holy Toledo. That's Midge Campbell.\nSANDY: Where? Who?\nSHELLY: Right smack in back of you. Don't look.",
      "SANDY J.J: It's not Silly-Putty. I'm sorry, but I doubt it.\nSANDY: It's called S'morestozium.",
      "PANDORA: Put the potion in it.\nCASSIOPEIA: Friskity, triskity, briskity, boo; knickerty, knockerty, tockerty, too! And with this spell: Mama comes back -- alive!\nANDROMEDA: God save these bones.",
      "DINAH: My mother is a constellation. At least, part of one. A Swiss scientist named a hypothetical star after her.\nDR. HICKENLOOPER: What's it called?\nDINAH: Midge Campbell X-9 Major.\nDR. HICKENLOOPER: I'll look it up."
    ]
  },
